    * candidates = [p for p in asymptotic if p.dt >= dt_t]
    * if candidates: dt_s = min(candidates by dt)  (closest from above)
      bound = abs(diff(dt_s)) * (dt_t/dt_s)^2
    * else: dt_s = finest asymptotic point (dt < dt_t); bound = abs(diff(dt_s))
    * rel_bound = bound / plateau
    * symmetric pass = rel_bound <= TOL
